        Effective Date: 04/01/2025<br>

        1. Introduction:<br>
        Welcome to VerseVine. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website, or use our services.<br>

        2. Information We Collect:<br>
        We may collect the following types of information:<br>

        2.1. Personal Information You Provide:<br>

        Name, email address, and any other details you provide when creating an account, entering a verse or submitting a prayer request.<br>



        2.2. Automatically Collected Information:<br>

        IP address, browser type, operating system, and browsing behavior through cookies or similar technologies.<br>



        2.3. Third-Party Data:<br>

        Information shared with us by third-party platforms when you interact with our services via social media or external accounts.<br>




        3. How And For What Do We Use Your Information:<br>

        - Provide and improve our website and services.<br>

        - Personalize user experience.<br>

        - Respond to inquiries, prayer requests, and provide support.<br>

        - Send updates, newsletters, or promotional material (with your consent).<br>

        - Ensure compliance with applicable legal obligations.<br>


        4. Sharing Your Information:<br>
        We do not sell your information to third parties. However, we may share it with:<br>

        - Service Providers: Companies that assist us in hosting, analytics, or payment processing.<br>

        - Legal Authorities: When required by law or to protect our rights.<br>

        - Collaborative Users: Limited details may be shared within the website's collaborative features if you opt in.<br>


        5. Data Retention:<br>
        We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to provide services or comply with legal requirements.<br>

        6. Cookies and Tracking:<br>
        We use cookies to enhance your experience on our site. You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.<br>

        7. Your Rights:<br>
        Depending on your location, you may have rights under applicable privacy laws, such as:<br>

        - Accessing the data we hold about you.<br>

        - Requesting correction or deletion of your personal data.<br>

        - Withdrawing consent for data processing.<br>


        To exercise your rights, please contact us at VerseVine@livnelavan.com.<br>

        8. Security:<br>
        We implement industry-standard measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.<br>

        9. Third-Party Links:<br>
        Our website may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.<br>

        10. Updates to This Policy:<br>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.<br>

        11. Contact Us:<br>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br>

        Email: VerseVine@livnelavan.com<br>
